[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_ARMOR_3B_TRAMPOLINE]
Balloon & Trampoline Armor (Air)

[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_ARMOR_3B_TRAMPOLINE_desc]
By installing balloons and trampolines on the outside of the tank, not only can it bounce back enemy shells and catch enemy shells, but more importantly, the buoyancy of the balloon reduces the weight of the tank, thereby reducing the friction between the tank and the ground, improving the mobility of the tank and saving fuel consumption.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_ARMOR_3B_TRAMPOLINE]
气球蹦床装甲 (空)

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_ARMOR_3B_TRAMPOLINE_desc]
将气球和蹦床安装在坦克外面，不仅可以反弹敌军的炮弹、接住敌军的炮弹，更重要的是，气球的浮力减轻了坦克的重量，因此降低了坦克与地面的摩擦力，提高了坦克的机动性并节省了燃油消耗。
